{
  "_doc": "Hand decisions for tools/locales.py. Order: items (by id) > texts (exact) > rules (first match). A rule matches regexes on res / file / sink / ctx / owner / text; 'from' limits it to items whose automatic status is in the list. Reviewed in phase 2 on 2026-10-12.",
